 <section id="experience-platforms"><p>小红书与公众号原帖可能需要在对应平台中打开。下列链接已在公开页面中找到，正文尚未直接核实，因此仅提供原帖入口。</p><div class="lab-card-grid experience-grid"><% data.platform_links.forEach(r=>{ %><article class="lab-card"><div class="lab-card-body"><span class="lab-meta"><%= r.company %> · <%= r.platform %></span><h3><%= r.title %></h3><p><%= r.description %></p><div class="fl-actions"><a class="button secondary" href="<%= r.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">打开原帖 ↗</a><a href="<%= r.discovery %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看收录页</a></div></div></article><% }) %></div><p class="experience-note">在微信中可搜索“九坤投资招聘”；在小红书中按“公司名＋岗位＋面经”检索，再核对发帖时间、实习或校招类型及地区。</p></section>
